# Cloudflare Pages routing.
# Static files (portfolio/, og.jpg, llms.txt, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, assets/) are served first.
# Do NOT add a 404.html: its presence switches Pages out of automatic SPA mode, and Pages
# ignores "/* /index.html 200" proxy rules, so every deep route (/store/*, /legal/*, /admin/*)
# would 404. Unknown routes are handled in-app by NotFoundPage (robots noindex).
/portfolio      /portfolio/index.html   200
